OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain
OL,6,Fpossible tonight, most persistent
OL,7,Ffurther north, with clearer spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping towards dawn, allowing
OL,9,Ftemperatures to dip with a touch of
OL,10,Ffrost. Strong winds towards the coast
OL,11,Fat first add to the chill.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA bright start to the new
OL,14,Fweek, with sunny spells developing
OL,15,Fthrough the morning. Remaining dry
OL,16,Fthough feeling chilly. Though turning
OL,17,Fwet and windy into the evening from
OL,18,Fthe southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
